        { "id": "it-a2-confronti-3-u09", "rev": 1, "stage": "sentence", "text": "Secondo me, Roma è la città più bella del mondo.", "translation": "In my opinion, Rome is the most beautiful city in the world.", "distractors": ["In my opinion, Rome is the oldest city in the world.", "In my opinion, Rome is the most beautiful city in Italy."] },
